        "height": 300,
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## AI Social Media Auto-Poster\nForm (topic + audience) -> one AI agent researches via Tavily and returns 3 posts + 2 image prompts -> 2 images generated -> published to **LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram**.\n\n**Credentials needed:** OpenAI, Tavily, LinkedIn OAuth2, Facebook Graph (Page), Facebook Graph (Instagram), and a **Query Auth** credential for imgbb (name: `key`, value: your imgbb API key).\n\n**Notes**\n- Instagram needs a public JPEG URL, so the square image is hosted on imgbb (auto-deletes after 1h).\n- LinkedIn/Facebook posts are not retried to avoid duplicate posts.\n- Production form URL is public: add Basic Auth on the form trigger and set an Error Workflow in workflow settings.\n- Replace the Page / Instagram / LinkedIn person IDs with your own."
      },
